<!--
  Hardened runtime entitlements for sessionpipe (Developer ID, outside the Mac App Store).
  Deliberately empty: no get-task-allow (no debugger attach in a release), no
  disable-library-validation, no JIT (WebKit's JIT runs in Apple's WebContent process, not
  ours), no sandbox. Device keys live in the login keychain (NATIVE-SPEC §5.3), which needs
  no keychain-access-groups entitlement and so no provisioning profile.
-->
